107	  Add `expectBookingRulesHold(pool: Pool): Promise<void>` to `src/server/test-db.ts`. Task 8 reuses it. It asserts three things:
108	  - no active duplicate `(mentor_id, starts_at)`: `group by … having count(*) > 1` returns no rows;
